**Implementing New Features**

I'm currently focused on integrating the two requested features. The plan is to start with the floating WhatsApp button in the bottom-right corner. Following that, I'll tackle the time-based AI agent assistant popup, linking it to the specified Jotform URL. The aim is a seamless user experience.


**Designing the Popup**

